tugueseSpanish (Spain)Spanish (Latin America)ItalianBulgarianSimplified ChineseJapaneseKoreanFound any localization or controller issues in the demo? Let us know in the Steam Discussions or on our Discord server. Thanks for helping us improve the ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-18T15:47:03Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706687292","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3876300-1844751498219074","game_id":"steam-3876300","kind":"announcement","title":"Serbian Games Week and Localization Support!","summary":"We're taking part in the Games from Serbia Week!To celebrate this, and as we continue implementing new features, we've added support for Serbian, Russian, and Chinese!Support for many other languages is currently in development, and we'll be adding them soon.Some of the translations were done automatically, so if you spot any mistakes, please let us know in the relevant thread on our Steam Community page or on our Discord server.We're still working on the game, and we'll be sharing more news wit","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-23T16:57:27Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1844751498219074","verified_at":"2026-10-20T12:13:20Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-3876300-1827626365763594","game_id":"steam-3876300","kind":"announcement","title":"Main menu and Leaderboard fixes","summary":"We changed buttons in main menu to better reflect their intended meaning.Load Level button became Continue,Start Game changed to New Game.Also we added a warining window when pressing New Game. It's warning player about save delition:Leaderboards now showing friends records by default, not global ones.","occurred_at":null,"publi